# Desktop UI

- Keep the existing visual language (`cp-`, `sf-`, `gh-`, `studio-claude`). Polish; do not redesign.
- Routes: `apps/desktop/src/App.tsx`. Nav: `src/roles/catalog.ts`.
- Family surfaces belong in `src/components/family/`. Organization in `src/components/organization/`. Shared chrome in `src/components/shared/`.
- Settings tabs are registered in `src/features/settings-tabs.ts`.
- Feature flags: `src/features/flags.ts` until the slice is stable.
